{"3884800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Equitania", "steam_appid": 3884800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equitania is a horse racing game focused on archery. Jump over obstacles and slow down time to land perfect midair trickshots with ease. Chain them into impressive combos to complete challenges. Bond with your horse, level up and explore a world full of secrets as you search for your missing sister.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horseback Archery and Racing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/3568df8c3c32c24526a992ce2d949c9d.poster.avif?t=1776111629\" aria-label=\"Passing checkpoints\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/3568df8c3c32c24526a992ce2d949c9d.webm?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/3568df8c3c32c24526a992ce2d949c9d.mp4?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconnect Equitania's leyline network by racing and completing challenges. Speed is important, but it's more about precision and timing. Checkpoints, obstacles, and targets all reward between 1 and 100 harmony points based on your accuracy. Chain them together to earn huge combo bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combo will break on its own after a few seconds without a hit or when you make a mistake. A new combo begins with your next successful hit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Archery Focus State</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/c563f272caa11b6b87f63db6a48fe0fe.poster.avif?t=1776111629\" aria-label=\"Midjump trickshot in slowed time\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/c563f272caa11b6b87f63db6a48fe0fe.webm?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/c563f272caa11b6b87f63db6a48fe0fe.mp4?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus state slows down time to an almost standstill, helping you line up your shots and score perfect hits even in the middle of the most difficult jumps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Horse Silver</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/ccc285397fc8ed7196f0c8327ede4c83.poster.avif?t=1776111629\" aria-label=\"Communicate with our horse\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/ccc285397fc8ed7196f0c8327ede4c83.webm?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/ccc285397fc8ed7196f0c8327ede4c83.mp4?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silver is not just your horse. She's your sentient companion. Care for her to grow your bond and receive temporary bonuses for next race. You can even learn to feel her thoughts and communicate with her in a limited way. You will receive them as half prophecies, half riddles. It will be up to you to decipher them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/faa7c01c135631edafdf484e88a1e905.poster.avif?t=1776111629\" aria-label=\"Completing race and leveling up\" width=620 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/faa7c01c135631edafdf484e88a1e905.webm?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/faa7c01c135631edafdf484e88a1e905.mp4?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By completing challenges and progressing through the story you receive perk points. Use them to improve your riding and archery skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caring for your horse and progressing in her story are optional, but they will increase your bond and have an impact on the endgame. It will unlock new parts of Silver's story, and each level will grant a selection of special bonuses and abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/5501a89f761dc43c0629415965d5443a.poster.avif?t=1776111629\" aria-label=\"Completing challenges\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/5501a89f761dc43c0629415965d5443a.webm?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/5501a89f761dc43c0629415965d5443a.mp4?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equitania is a cozy fantasy world created by Iris to protect what she loves, but there is darkness underneath pretty flowers. The land itself is alive and wants to show you something. Explore ancient totems older than the land itself to uncover hidden memories and forbidden secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your long lost sister is in trouble and needs your help. She made her own virtual world free of suffering and death. She made it real, but a demon tricked her. Now she's trapped, her life is in danger and the foundation of the world itself is falling apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horse Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/7de2559685a15389e19370826f574740.poster.avif?t=1776111629\" aria-label=\"Coat selection\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/7de2559685a15389e19370826f574740.webm?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/7de2559685a15389e19370826f574740.mp4?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select one of many available coats, mane and tail colors and styles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horse Painter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want more than the standard coats? Paint your own coat with our Horse Painter. Blend any two standard coats and texture overlays. Use one of countless brushes to paint, stamp, blur, smudge, and erase normal or glow-in-the-dark color. There is also 3D painting for both metallic and non-metallic ornaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even players without art skills can use many predefined stamps and textures to create cool and original looks and share them with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/d0bc85be2c65e843a6fbae0cd0938bd6.avif?t=1776111629\" alt=\"Horse painter\" width=800 height=448 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equitania is a horse racing game focused on archery. Jump over obstacles and slow down time to land perfect midair trickshots with ease. Chain them into impressive combos to complete challenges. Bond with your horse, level up and explore a world full of secrets as you search for your missing sister.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horseback Archery and Racing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/3568df8c3c32c24526a992ce2d949c9d.poster.avif?t=1776111629\" aria-label=\"Passing checkpoints\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/3568df8c3c32c24526a992ce2d949c9d.webm?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/3568df8c3c32c24526a992ce2d949c9d.mp4?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconnect Equitania's leyline network by racing and completing challenges. Speed is important, but it's more about precision and timing. Checkpoints, obstacles, and targets all reward between 1 and 100 harmony points based on your accuracy. Chain them together to earn huge combo bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combo will break on its own after a few seconds without a hit or when you make a mistake. A new combo begins with your next successful hit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Archery Focus State</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/c563f272caa11b6b87f63db6a48fe0fe.poster.avif?t=1776111629\" aria-label=\"Midjump trickshot in slowed time\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/c563f272caa11b6b87f63db6a48fe0fe.webm?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/c563f272caa11b6b87f63db6a48fe0fe.mp4?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus state slows down time to an almost standstill, helping you line up your shots and score perfect hits even in the middle of the most difficult jumps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Horse Silver</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/ccc285397fc8ed7196f0c8327ede4c83.poster.avif?t=1776111629\" aria-label=\"Communicate with our horse\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/ccc285397fc8ed7196f0c8327ede4c83.webm?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/ccc285397fc8ed7196f0c8327ede4c83.mp4?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silver is not just your horse. She's your sentient companion. Care for her to grow your bond and receive temporary bonuses for next race. You can even learn to feel her thoughts and communicate with her in a limited way. You will receive them as half prophecies, half riddles. It will be up to you to decipher them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/faa7c01c135631edafdf484e88a1e905.poster.avif?t=1776111629\" aria-label=\"Completing race and leveling up\" width=620 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/faa7c01c135631edafdf484e88a1e905.webm?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/faa7c01c135631edafdf484e88a1e905.mp4?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By completing challenges and progressing through the story you receive perk points. Use them to improve your riding and archery skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caring for your horse and progressing in her story are optional, but they will increase your bond and have an impact on the endgame. It will unlock new parts of Silver's story, and each level will grant a selection of special bonuses and abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/5501a89f761dc43c0629415965d5443a.poster.avif?t=1776111629\" aria-label=\"Completing challenges\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/5501a89f761dc43c0629415965d5443a.webm?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/5501a89f761dc43c0629415965d5443a.mp4?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equitania is a cozy fantasy world created by Iris to protect what she loves, but there is darkness underneath pretty flowers. The land itself is alive and wants to show you something. Explore ancient totems older than the land itself to uncover hidden memories and forbidden secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your long lost sister is in trouble and needs your help. She made her own virtual world free of suffering and death. She made it real, but a demon tricked her. Now she's trapped, her life is in danger and the foundation of the world itself is falling apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horse Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/7de2559685a15389e19370826f574740.poster.avif?t=1776111629\" aria-label=\"Coat selection\" width=620 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/7de2559685a15389e19370826f574740.webm?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/7de2559685a15389e19370826f574740.mp4?t=1776111629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select one of many available coats, mane and tail colors and styles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horse Painter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want more than the standard coats? Paint your own coat with our Horse Painter. Blend any two standard coats and texture overlays. Use one of countless brushes to paint, stamp, blur, smudge, and erase normal or glow-in-the-dark color. There is also 3D painting for both metallic and non-metallic ornaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even players without art skills can use many predefined stamps and textures to create cool and original looks and share them with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884800/extras/d0bc85be2c65e843a6fbae0cd0938bd6.avif?t=1776111629\" alt=\"Horse painter\" width=800 height=448 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Equitania is a horse racing game focused on archery. Jump over obstacles and slow down time to land perfect midair trickshots with ease. Chain them into impressive combos to complete challenges. Bond with your horse, level up and explore a world full 